Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 02:12:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] fix(llms): keep Bedrock tool call ids unique across
 conversation turns

- Check Bedrock ids against earlier tool calls, results, and session ids.
- Keep the 128 most recent sessions under metadata.sessionId, the session id.
- Add the smallest free suffix: call_0 becomes call_0-2, then call_0-3.
- Keep replacement ids within 64 characters using Bedrock's [a-zA-Z0-9_-] pattern.
- Keep matching ids for tool calls, results, and same-call errors.
- Leave other providers unchanged.
- Prevent repeats after GLM 5.3 reused call_0 three times across turns.
- Add 9 cases in ai-sdk.tool-call-ids.test.ts, with initial failures recorded.
